        "name": "Rootcaller",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Ivern conjures a vine, dealing damage and rooting enemy targets hit. Ivern's allies can dash to the rooted target.",
        "bodyHtml": "Ivern conjures a vine dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(80/125/170/215/260 + (70% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Rooting</span> the first enemy hit for 1.6/1.7/1.8/1.9/2 seconds. Allies that Attack a <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Rooted</span> enemy dash into Attack Range. <br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast:</span> Ivern dashes directly onto the <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Rooted</span> enemy.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Hitting non-epic monsters reduces <span>Rootcaller's</span> cooldown by 50%.</span>",
