      "W": {
        "slot": "W",
        "id": "IvernW",
        "name": "Brushmaker",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "In brush, Ivern and his nearby allies attacks deal bonus magic damage. Ivern can activate this ability to create a patch of brush.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Passive:</span> While in brush and for 3 seconds after leaving, Ivern's Attacks deal an additional <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(20/27.5/35/42.5/50 + (20% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>. Nearby allies will gain this effect for 1.5 seconds and deal <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(10/15/20/25/30 + (10% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold\">Active:</span> Ivern grows a patch of Brush, revealing the area for 8 seconds. The Brush persists until Ivern's team loses vision within it, or up to 45 seconds.",
