        "name": "Triggerseed",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Ivern places a shield on an ally which explodes after a short duration slowing and damaging enemies. The shield refreshes if it hits no enemies.",
        "bodyHtml": "Ivern grants <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">(75/115/155/195/235 + (50% Ability Power)) Shield</span> to an ally champion or Daisy. After 2 seconds, it bursts, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(70/90/110/130/150 + (80% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowing</span> enemies by 40/45/50/55/60% for 2 seconds.<br /><br />If <span>Triggerseed</span> detonates and no enemy champions are hit while the shield still persists, the ally will be shielded for <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">(75/115/155/195/235 + (50% Ability Power)) </span>for 2 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Can also be used on Daisy.</span>",
